// DELIBERATE ERROR + host-dependent (needs `reenter`, see f5): yielding
// across a live host call boundary must be the teaching runtime error,
// never corruption. Ported 0.3.x doctrine: natives are atomic.
var f = Fiber.new(func() {
    reenter(func() { Fiber.yield(1) })
    return 0
})
Fiber.call(f)
